   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 3.1. Increased capacity of Member States to formulate and implement national employment policies in response to the COVID-19 crisis</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In January 2023, the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development launched a capacity and institutional building programme on the National Employment Policy implementation that is comprehensive and sustainable, which will be crucial for the effective implementation of and follow-up on the Policy. With the support from the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, the ILO developed the second phase proposal for the Programme of Cooperation between the ILO and the KSA in collaboration with the Ministry. The ILO provided capacity building on National Employment Policy development, implementation, moniotring and evaluation to strengthen the capacities for the effective implementation, moniotring and evaluation of the National Employment Policy.</narrative>
   </description>
